    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Thru is a single player cooking time management game where the player must be fast and precise in order to maintain a good overall restaurant rating. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange your workstation to optimize your workflow, assemble various burgers, and don't burn the fries!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve your drive thru customers quickly and accurately to get <strong>5 star ratings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains many <strong>sides and ingredients</strong>: from pineapple and eggs on your burger to blueberry muffins, donuts, and coffee for breakfast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't drop the food on the floor or let it sit too long on a table or it will eventually <strong>spoil!</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers may <strong>customize</strong> their orders such as ask for a cheeseburger with extra cheese and a slice of tomato.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rearrange</strong> your grill, tables, and ingredients to the most ideal setup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>debris</strong> to get more space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't <strong>undercook</strong> or <strong>overcook</strong> burgers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Package the food and hand it off at the <strong>drive thru window</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your character's <strong>sprint energy</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial, 3 levels, and an <strong>unlimited mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has both keyboard and <strong>controller</strong> support.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive Thru is a single player cooking time management game where the player must be fast and precise in order to maintain a good overall restaurant rating. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rearrange your workstation to optimize your workflow, assemble various burgers, and don't burn the fries!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve your drive thru customers quickly and accurately to get <strong>5 star ratings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains many <strong>sides and ingredients</strong>: from pineapple and eggs on your burger to blueberry muffins, donuts, and coffee for breakfast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't drop the food on the floor or let it sit too long on a table or it will eventually <strong>spoil!</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers may <strong>customize</strong> their orders such as ask for a cheeseburger with extra cheese and a slice of tomato.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rearrange</strong> your grill, tables, and ingredients to the most ideal setup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear <strong>debris</strong> to get more space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't <strong>undercook</strong> or <strong>overcook</strong> burgers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Package the food and hand it off at the <strong>drive thru window</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your character's <strong>sprint energy</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial, 3 levels, and an <strong>unlimited mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has both keyboard and <strong>controller</strong> support.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A fast paced time management cooking game where you run a drive thru. Manage your kitchen, be precise and serve your customers fast! Don't drop the food or burn the fries!",
